" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M505 174.8l-39.6-39.6c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L192 374.7 80.6 263.2c-9.4-9.4-24.6-9.4-33.9 0L7 302.9c-9.4 9.4-9.4 24.6 0 34L175 505c9.4 9.4 24.6 9.4 33.9 0l296-296.2c9.4-9.5 9.4-24.7.1-34zm-324.3 106c6.2 6.3 16.4 6.3 22.6 0l208-208.2c6.2-6.3 6.2-16.4 0-22.6L366.1 4.7c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L192 156.2l-55.4-55.5c-6.2-6.3-16.4-6.3-22.6 0L68.7 146c-6.2 6.3-6.2 16.4 0 22.6l112 112.2z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Blood stains on sheets or mattress.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5572e05 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5572e05\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-37c11f4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"37c11f4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-13c9657 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"13c9657\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-bab7bf7\" data-id=\"bab7bf7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f278feb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f278feb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Key Facts<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de80c72 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"de80c72\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \"> Key Facts About Bed Bug in Melbourne Infestations and Expert Extermination<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dfb611e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dfb611e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Bed bugs Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> are small, oval-shaped insects measuring 4\u20135 mm when fully grown. Even though they are wingless, they move fast and can easily infest homes, hotels, and offices.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61ad738 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"61ad738\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Typically reddish-brown in colour, <\/span><b>bed bugs<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> become darker after feeding on human blood. Their flat bodies help them hide in cracks, crevices, mattresses, clothes, and luggage, making <\/span><b>bed bug removal Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> challenging without professional help.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6eca234 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6eca234\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A <\/span><b>bed bug Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> life cycle includes five nymph stages before adulthood. Each stage requires a blood meal every 7\u201310 days, and adults may live 6\u201312 months. With each female laying 2\u20133 eggs daily, infestations spread quickly.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3948ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d3948ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For effective <\/span><b>bed bug pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, trust a certified <\/span><b>bed bug exterminator Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> who can provide reliable <\/span><b>bed bug extermination Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services and safeguard your property.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a1ad48f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a1ad48f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e5bbdc9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e5bbdc9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-999f533 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"999f533\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/End-of-Lease-1.jpg.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1668\" alt=\"bed bug control melbourne\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/End-of-Lease-1.jpg.webp 948w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/End-of-Lease-1.jpg-300x200.webp 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/End-of-Lease-1.jpg-768x513.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11d80bc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"11d80bc\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e64c170 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"e64c170\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-tit