container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6a16cda505b7c\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card active\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-57e8489\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-6f491396a16cda505b7c\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-6f491396a16cda505b7c\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-6f491396a16cda505b7c\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">1. What is the cost of bed bug extermination in Melbourne?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-6f491396a16cda505b7c\" class=\" show collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-57e8489\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6a16cda505b7c\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Bed bug extermination in Melbourne usually costs between $200 to $500 depending on infestation level and treatment method. <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> offers effective and affordable solutions.<\/span><\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-57e8489\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-042b3786a16cda505b7c\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-042b3786a16cda505b7c\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-042b3786a16cda505b7c\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">2. How do I choose the best bed bug exterminator in Melbourne?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-042b3786a16cda505b7c\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-57e8489\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6a16cda505b7c\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Choose a licensed and experienced company with strong customer reviews and proven results. <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> is a trusted choice for reliable bed bug removal.<\/span><\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-57e8489\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-fcc8da46a16cda505b7c\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-fcc8da46a16cda505b7c\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-fcc8da46a16cda505b7c\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">3. How long does it take to get rid of bed bugs completely?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-fcc8da46a16cda505b7c\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-57e8489\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6a16cda505b7c\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Bed bug treatment may take a few hours, but complete removal can take multiple visits depending on the severity of the infestation.<\/span><\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-57e8489\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-247bb1b6a16cda505b7c\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-247bb1b6a16cda505b7c\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-247bb1b6a16cda505b7c\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">4. Do you offer bed bug treatment in Melbourne CBD?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-247bb1b6a16cda505b7c\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-3-57e8489\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6a16cda505b7c\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes, <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> provides bed bug extermination services across Melbourne, including CBD and surrounding areas.<\/span><\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-4-57e8489\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-43386d36a16cda505b7c\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-43386d36a16cda505b7c\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-43386d36a16cda505b7c\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">5. What is the most effective treatment for bed bugs?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-43386d36a16cda505b7c\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-4-57e8489\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6a16cda505b7c\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Professional treatments like heat treatment and chemical solutions are highly effective. <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> uses advanced methods to ensure complete bed bug removal.<\/span><\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                                                        <script type=\"application\/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"1. What is the cost of bed bug extermination in Melbourne?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Bed bug extermination in Melbourne usually costs between $200 to $500 depending on infestation level and treatment method. <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\"> offers effective and affordable solutions.<\/span><\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"2. How do I choose the best bed bug exterminator in Melbourne?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Choose a licensed and experienced company with strong customer reviews and proven results. <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\"> is a trusted choice for reliable bed bug removal.<\/span><\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"3. How long does it take to get rid of bed bugs completely?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Bed bug treatment may take a few hours, but complete removal can take multiple visits depending on the severity of the infestation.<\/span><\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"4. Do you offer bed bug treatment in Melbourne CBD?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Yes, <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\"> provides bed bug extermination services across Melbourne, including CBD and surrounding areas.<\/span><\/p>\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"5. What is the most effective treatment for bed bugs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\">Professional treatments like heat treatment and chemical solutions are highly effective. <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\\\"font-weight: 400\\\"> uses advanced methods to ensure complete bed bug removal.<\/span><\/p>\"}}]}<\/script>\n                                <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6939443\" data-id=\"6939443\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-f149059 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"f149059\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-a42eae7\" data-id=\"a42eae7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6867be7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6867be7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"1280\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2024-08-28-at-15.35.06_bc7d2870-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-778\" alt=\"7 States Pest Control\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcont